1
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:05,780
GPT-6.1 Sol。
GPT-6.1 Sol.

2
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:08,370
网友已经拿它做出了这些。
Netizens have already built these with it.

3
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:13,880
OpenAI 开发者大会，发布了 GPT-6.1 Sol。
At OpenAI's developer conference, GPT-6.1 Sol was released.

4
00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:17,120
接近旗舰 Astra，价格只有五分之一。
Near-flagship Astra performance, at one fifth of the price.

5
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:21,010
每百万 token，输入 2 美元，输出 10 美元。
Per million tokens: $2 for input, $10 for output.

6
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:25,650
还有 Ultrafast，最高 8 倍速度。
Plus Ultrafast: up to 8x the speed.

7
00:00:25,670 --> 00:00:28,920
同一个提示造火箭，左边已经起飞。
Same prompt, one rocket build: the left side has already lifted off.

8
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:34,390
同一个任务：做一个 3D 游戏原型。
Same task: build a 3D game prototype.

9
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:36,930
上面是 Sol，下面是 Astra。
Sol on top, Astra below.

10
00:00:38,900 --> 00:00:42,640
Higgsfield 说，Sol 快 4 倍，成本五分之一。
Higgsfield says Sol is 4x faster, at one fifth of the cost.

11
00:00:52,900 --> 00:00:56,000
四个模型，同一个提示词，做斗兽场。
Four models, one prompt: build the Colosseum.

12
00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:02,980
发帖的人说，Astra Pro 和 Sol 感觉很像。
The poster says Astra Pro and Sol feel very similar.

13
00:01:05,600 --> 00:01:08,630
发帖的人说，这个爱琴海是 Astra 写的。
The poster says Astra wrote this Aegean scene.

14
00:01:21,100 --> 00:01:22,790
Sol 做的秋天。
Autumn, made by Sol.

15
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:30,770
发帖的人说，API 只花 1.5 美元。
The poster says the API cost just $1.50.

16
00:01:30,790 --> 00:01:34,480
他说，设计水平是 Opus 的八成，成本 4%。
He says the design is 80% of Opus, at 4% of the cost.

17
00:01:38,500 --> 00:01:41,090
再看物理：猕猴桃果冻。
Now physics: a slice of kiwi jelly.

18
00:01:47,600 --> 00:01:51,690
发帖的人说：Sol 更省钱，Astra 的果冻物理更完美。
The poster says: Sol saves more money, Astra's jelly physics is better.

19
00:01:55,500 --> 00:02:00,640
开发者 Ashe 用 Astra 做的人体图谱，2,234 个部件。
A human atlas by developer Ashe, built with Astra: 2,234 parts.

20
00:02:17,500 --> 00:02:21,390
这是 dots，OpenAI 这次发布的常开智能体。
This is dots, the always-on agent OpenAI just released.

21
00:02:26,600 --> 00:02:30,150
让新模型用 Blender MCP，重建一只 dots。
The new model rebuilds a dots character through Blender MCP.

22
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:39,930
最后，一比一的地球。
Last one: the Earth at 1:1 scale.

23
00:02:40,500 --> 00:02:42,750
从太空，一路降到海面。
From space, all the way down to the sea.

24
00:02:48,500 --> 00:02:53,230
发帖的人说：项目是 Sol 搭的，地球是 Astra Max 做的。
The poster says: Sol built the project, Astra Max made the Earth.

25
00:03:13,100 --> 00:03:15,520
链接在这里，扫码就能玩。
The link is right here. Scan it to play.
